 # PROGRAMM|KLASSEKÜRZEL-ELEMENT = ** **-<ELEMENT> *-* *-*-<ELEMENT> #
### ==== ##### == # === STARTPUNKT ABSOLULATOR  === # == ##### === ###

NAME           Ð ABSOLULATOR

 INFO-ID       = ABSOLULATOR

MASTER         § MASU-ABSOLULATOR

